### Payments (fake provider locally). Needs a COMPLETED checkout from http/storefront.http:
### its checkoutId and the cart token (X-Cart-Token), plus accessToken/storeId for the merchant part.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@host = PASTE_HANDLE.storeforge.localhost
@checkoutId = PASTE_CHECKOUT_ID
@cartToken = PASTE_CART_TOKEN
@orderId = PASTE_ORDER_ID
@intentId = PASTE_INTENT_ID_FROM_CLIENT_SECRET

### Start the payment (or get the existing one; safe to retry). clientSecret = "<intentId>_secret_..."
POST {{base}}/storefront/v1/checkouts/{{checkoutId}}/payment
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}

### What the browser does with the provider's card form (fake provider only!)
### 4242424242424242 succeeds, 4000000000000002 is declined. The webhook arrives asynchronously.
POST {{base}}/fake-provider/v1/payment_intents/{{intentId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"card": "4242424242424242"}

### Poll the outcome ("processing" page)
GET {{base}}/storefront/v1/checkouts/{{checkoutId}}/payment
X-Forwarded-Host: {{host}}
X-Cart-Token: {{cartToken}}

### Merchant: payment, refunds, provider operations (attempts, UNKNOWN outcomes)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Merchant: refund (Idempotency-Key required; resend the same key = same refund)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 7b0c6c2e-2f7e-4b4e-9f5e-0e1c0d9a1111
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": "10.00", "reason": "customer_request"}
